{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced combat game starring little white characters. The controls are simple: dodge when enemies attack, then immediately press the attack button to instantly move behind the enemy and strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can also <strong>parry enemy attacks</strong> by pressing the attack button at the right moment, briefly stunning the enemy. Use this window to unleash your combos\u2014but be careful! If you get hit, the enemy will create an explosion around you that deals damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also features a <strong>scoring system</strong>, with a maximum score of 100. Can you achieve a perfect score? Give it your best shot!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4123050?t=1762980512","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123050/77ce685df704238d431ea4c200b9375ce5e9a8c9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762980512","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123050/056a3ae5f28bb9608fe01e898796c9e18f708945/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762980512","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123050/056a3ae5f28bb9608fe01e898796c9e18f708945/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762980512","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced combat game starring little white characters. The controls are simple: dodge when enemies attack, then immediately press the attack button to instantly move behind the enemy and strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can also <strong>parry enemy attacks</strong> by pressing the attack button at the right moment, briefly stunning the enemy. Use this window to unleash your combos\u2014but be careful! If you get hit, the enemy will create an explosion around you that deals damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also features a <strong>scoring system</strong>, with a maximum score of 100. Can you achieve a perfect score? Give it your best shot!</p>","developers":["KongshiStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123050/43cb2ee28fb5dadb1e85ba87a401fc6501bec918/header.jpg?t=1762980512","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4123050/1893962493/e7f3a21e864dd022d8350886e0ad09d3c85cc4c6/1762232506/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762233653","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4123050/1893962493/e7f3a21e864dd022d8350886e0ad09d3c85cc4c6/1762232506/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762233653","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4123050/1893962493/e7f3a21e864dd022d8350886e0ad09d3c85cc4c6/1762232506/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762233653","id":257226513,"name":"\u9810\u544a\u5ba3\u50b3\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257226513/655656a5756dc1da6ebb3ccdf4b908c6895a4414/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762233653"}],"name":"Little White: Chromatic Clash","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Little White: Chromatic Clash - $2.99 USD","packageid":1444704,